  "description": "Aftermarket towing side mirrors are designed to replace factory mirrors at a margin of cost from dealers. YITAMOTOR towing mirrors are perfect for direct replacement or refitted non-towed side mirrors. Towing mirrors must be functional when you need to tow any type of trailer, boat, or cargo.\nFitment\n2004 - 2006 Ford F150 Series Truck\nNot Fit for 2004 F-150 Heritag\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nVarious Functions\nFeaturing a power-adjustable & power-heated plane mirror, the manually adjustable convex lens, led turn signal light, puddle light, manual telescoping & manual folding, the multifunctional side mirrors can strikingly enhance your driving experience.\nMirrors Adjustment\nThe power-adjustable flat mirror and manually adjustable convex lens enable you to flexibly adjust the rearview and get a suitable picture of your vehicle's surroundings.\nAluminum Triangle Base\nThe towing mirrors can stably be installed on your vehicle as they adopt classic triangle construction, durable aluminum base, and pre-installed studs.\nEasy to install\nJust simply connect the plugs of the trailer towing mirror to the corresponding power cord, no drilling or modifications are required（professional installation would be highly recommended)",
